{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26926","headline":"省直书事 · 姚合","name":"省直书事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"默默沧江老，官分右掖荣。\n立朝班近殿，奏直上知名。\n晓雾和香气，晴楼下乐声。\n蜀牋金屑腻，月兔笔毫精。\n禁树霏烟覆，宫墙瑞草生。\n露盘秋更出，玉漏昼还清。\n碧藓无尘染，寒蝉似鸟鸣。\n竹深云自宿，天近日先明。\n孱懦难封诏，疎愚但掷觥。\n素飡终日足，宁免衆人轻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26926.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26926","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}